<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24473" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δημ-ώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>popular</i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μουσική, σωφροσύνη,</span>
			<i>in the popular sense,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				61a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				710a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρεταὶ καὶ κακίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1.217
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>; <i>hackneyed,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοινὰ καὶ δ. ὀνόματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longin.
					40.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στιχίδια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Per.</u>
					30
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				3.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				3.45
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δ. πλῆθος,</span> of
			civilians, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατιωτικοί,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				1.4.8
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1.15.7
			</span></i>; of a prostitute, <i>common,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				7.345
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apollon.Cit.
					1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
